  "content": "Triple Positive Natural Breast Cancer ThriverRR Admin - MBSDec 5, 20241 min readDiagnosed in 2017 with breast cancer, from day one Wafaa started her research and found that there are other ways to treat cancer than conventional therapies. She made the decision to decline conventional treatments and take a holistic path. Traveling to Germany, Switzerland, Hungary and a few other countries she visited clinics offering alternative therapies where she did treatments such as hyperthermia, ozone therapy, IV infusions and more, in addition to adopting many lifestyle changes. With each passing day, she felt better and better. She has been monitoring her tumors via PET scans and has been stable for 5 years. During her cancer journey, Wafaa spent lots of time reading and researching, she has received 5 certifications in holistic health and is now studying Naturopathy and to become a Radical Remission Health Coach.To connect directly with Wafaa, please email her at drwafaaa1@gmail.com. Listen to Wafaa's story and others like it here.If you prefer to read the podcast healing story, please visit Apple Podcasts. Once in the episode, scroll down below the show notes for the automatically generated, unedited transcript. (Available in the Apple Podcast app only)485485 views00 commentsPost not marked as liked",
